  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><strong>Family Plant</strong></p><p><strong>Anima Weapon </strong>@UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.spells.Item.YWxyLq39RYfOqnGb]{Anima Weapon: Wild Fruit}</p><p><strong>Anima Morph </strong>@UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.spells.bOOW1gglIkECyphH]{Anima Morph: Wild Fruit}</p><p><strong>Anima Ability</strong> @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.spells.Item.xMNJ9mb3YacM917V]{Anima Ability: Wild Fruit}</p><hr><p class=\"MsoNormal\">You create a magical fruit that, when eaten, quickly restores wounds and injuries. The number of actions determines the efficacy of the magical fruit’s healing and range.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span class=\"action-glyph\"><strong>1</strong></span> You can only offer a bite of the wild magical fruit. The spell’s range is touch, and it heals 6 hit points.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span class=\"action-glyph\"><strong>2</strong></span> You launch a succulent fruit, and its juices invigorate the target. The spell’s range is 30 feet, and it heals 1d6 + 6 hit points.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The healing increases by 6 points. If you spend 2 actions, the healing increases by 1d6+6 points.</p>"
